WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:42.510
The first match of the finals, Max vs Gaou, was a fierce battle, well suited for the climax of this competition!

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:46.910
Let's hope the next match will be just as exciting!

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:53.090
Rei, you absolutely have to win this! You gotta avenge Max, okay?

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:57.090
Next, fighting the second match, from the Chinese team,

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:59.490
will be Mao!

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:05.600
If you underestimate her because she's a girl, next thing you know her Beyblade Galux will slice you up!

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:09.090
Mao, you're beautiful! You have to win!

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:11.410
Mao-chan, you're a cutie pie!

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:14.070
<i>Wow!</i> It's like she's an idol!

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:16.450
That girl sure is popular.

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:20.500
She's a female Blader, and we're in her home town. Plus, she's cute.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.600
They can't help but be attracted to her.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:25.060
What's with that look?

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:29.820
Are you sure it's not 'them' but you who's attracted to her?

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.380
I'm just stating the common opinion!

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:38.950
And for the opposing BBA team, we have Rei and his Beyblade Driger, who will fight with his secret move, the Tiger Claw!

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:42.380
Rei-sama, marry me!

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:43.540
You're marvelous!

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:45.440
I love you!

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:49.600
Rei is popular too. After all, this is <i>his</i> home town as well.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.500
Tsk! What a bunch of morons!

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:56.210
When you're fighting, it doesn't matter whether you're a boy or a girl!

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:57.450
That's right.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.950
And the one who will lose this fight...

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.410
Might be Rei.

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:05.130
What? Why?!

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:09.820
Sure, Byakko is back. But we can't be sure that Rei will be able to give it all in this fight.

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.750
Let's just hope it doesn't end like when he fought Kiki.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:17.610
He will be fine. We're the BBA team.

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:20.880
We have faith in our comrades
and confidence in ourselves. Right?

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:22.130
Yeah

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:27.360
Anyway! I know that Rei
will make it for sure. Do your best, Rei!

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:32.370
Byakko vs Mountain Cat

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:38.210
Well then, let's take a look
at the special stadium for this fight!

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.460
Wow!

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:59.390
Incredible! The Bey Stadium for the second round is a faithful reproduction of the Forbidden City,

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:04.320
the ancient imperial palace and the biggest wooden architectural monument in the world!

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.770
Many passages running across its walls.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:15.570
Who will be able to survive until the end on this unstable terrain?

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:20.070
Rei! You won't last a minute! You've already lost!

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:24.200
Do whatever it takes to win!
You just can't lose this one, Rei!

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:27.490
Well then, let's go with the first battle!

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:30.580
Three, Two, One!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.970
Go... Shoot!

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:36.050
Go, Galux!

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:43.550
I'm gonna get you!

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.850
Where are you, Galux..?

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:56.740
Here I am, Rei!

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:05.500
Wow! With a fierce strike, Mao's Beyblade Galux makes Driger waver!

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:06.660
Oh no!

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:07.800
This is my chance!

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:11.750
Go, Galux! Tear him apart with your Caty Bites!

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:26.820
Galux's slashing attacks aren't letting up!

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:30.420
Driger is struggling just to dodge them!

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:32.190
Don't lose, Driger!

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:42.660
Alright! Go, Rei! Do it!

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:48.130
Oh, this it a great chance for Driger to take down Galux and end this battle!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.130
Go, Driger!

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:56.290
What?!

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:59.050
The one who's gonna end this battle... Is me!

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:17.610
It's over! After dodging Driger's
attack, Galux blew him away!

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:20.910
The first battle ends with Mao's victory!

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:25.210
Rei-nii...

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:29.440
That was oddly quick, don't you think?

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:31.250
Doesn't feel like a final to me.

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:34.370
Oh come on, Rei! What the heck are you doing?!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.300
Why didn't you attack her when you had the chance?!

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:39.300
He held back... He's too naive.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:45.030
Not only did you hesitate to defeat her, but you also got defeated yourself.

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.260
Naive.

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:47.580
What?!

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:54.740
<i>No!</i> Rai knows what he should do! Both as a Beyblader and as a person recognized by Byakko!

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:58.270
Yeah, that's right! Rei will... Rei will..!

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:01.040
Fight, Rei! Do your best!

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:04.160
Rei! Don't overthink things and just go all out!

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:06.790
Rei-nii.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:11.040
Stop taking me lightly already!

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:14.040
Do you think I'm happy when
you hold back against me?!

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:16.240
Mao...

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:19.000
Fight me like you mean it!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.080
You're here now because
you wanted to be, right?

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:27.920
Let's move on to the second battle!

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:31.590
Three, Two, One!

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:32.890
Go, Shoot!

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:37.140
Mao! Your opponent is scared! Go ahead and settle this!

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:46.720
W-Wow! Will Driger go down without
a fight  just like in the first battle?

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:51.170
You are here now because you wanted to, isn't that so?

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:57.490
Fight properly, Rei-nii! For
Byakko's sake! For y<i>our own</i> sake!

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:00.490
I will...

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:04.920
If you're unable to fight me with all you have, then leave this stadium!

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:08.020
And never show yourself to me again!

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:13.430
I... I don't want to see you like this, Rei-nii!

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.050
I am...

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:19.820
You were chosen by Byakko, did you forget?!

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:25.300
Rei!

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:30.650
Rei.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:34.400
Your desire to fight against the world...

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:36.500
Was it just talk?

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:37.180
What..?

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:39.410
Stop messing around!

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:47.520
We have only just begun.

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:49.260
Hurry up and end this.

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:06.440
Yeah, you're right.

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:08.140
Rei-nii..?

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:16.900
I did <i>not</i> leave the Byakko Clan
with half-hearted determination.

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:20.480
And I didn't leave so I could hold
back against my opponents.

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:27.200
I did it so I could fight with all
I have, and to live life my way!

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:31.480
Show me your power, Rei-nii! The power of someone who was chosen by Byakko!

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.750
Let's do this, Byakko!

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:41.390
We're aiming for the world!

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:48.240
Caty Bites!

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:50.770
Tiger Claw!

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:54.230
Both fighters are fiercely plunging in!

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:05.200
Oh, Driger is wavering! Looks like it might fall down any moment.

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:08.710
Will this settle the Chinese team's victory?

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:15.730
Oh?! W-What in the world just happened?

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:21.140
Galux suddenly fell, and the second battle is won by Driger and Rei!

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:24.890
Alright! He did it! With this, the score is tied.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.950
This is getting interesting!

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:31.060
But for a moment there,
I was really scared.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:33.590
It's okay. No need to worry, Professor!

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.110
There's <i>no problem</i> now.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.880
That's right. You saw this battle, right?

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:42.330
It's gonna be fine. Rei will win
the next one too! I just know it.

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:46.540
Exactly. The only thing we
can do now is cheer him on.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:49.090
Let's show him our support!

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:50.080
- Yeah!
- Do your best!

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:53.090
- Do your best, Rei!
- You got this, Rei!

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:57.440
See? You can do it if you try.

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:02.590
I told you I won't lose.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:05.440
Let's have a good match, Mao.

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:11.190
Of course, who do you take me for? I let my guard down a bit earlier, but I'm going to win this for sure.

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:14.280
I'm going to settle the victory for the Chinese team.

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:21.030
Dang it, Mao! Why did you have to tell him those things?!

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:24.050
Now you've made him regain confidence, you fool!

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:42.150
Whatever happens next, this will be the end.

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:46.100
Will the Chinese team win this
battle and the tournament?

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:52.100
Or will the BBA team overcome this battle and leave Takao to settle the final score?

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:55.690
Whatever the conclusion, everything will be decided with this battle!

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.460
Are you both ready?

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:59.150
Let's go!

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:02.660
Three, Two, One!

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:04.660
Go... Shoot!

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:13.280
Wow! Right from the start, Galux turns the corner and enters the castle road!

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:15.350
And Driger chases after it!

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:18.210
Rei-nii, can you catch up to me?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.000
Oh, I will!

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:26.180
I'm not gonna let you get away!

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:30.550
Wow! What's going on?!

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:33.010
Galux disappeared again!

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:35.550
Where did you vanish to, Galux?!

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.060
I'm up here!

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:43.310
Go, Galux! Caty Bites!

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:50.040
He dodged it?!

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.920
I won't fall for the same move again!

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:03.590
Don't give in, Galux!

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:07.100
Drigar, show her your dormant power!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:17.280
How do you like it, Mao?!

00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:18.770
Not enough to beat me!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:37.970
It's been a long time since I've had this much fun in a Bey battle.

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:40.250
Yeah. It's the same for me, Mao.

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:43.440
I-I can't believe my eyes!

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:48.420
The two Beyblades are moving around as if they were living beings with a soul of their own!

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:51.760
Are they being possessed by the spirits of the contestants?!

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:58.290
I'm Mao-chan's fan, but Rei, I'm rooting for you!

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.540
Do your best!

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:02.090
Mao-chan, give it your all!

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:09.550
Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:10.360
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:13.880
W-What's going on? Why is
the audience going crazy like this?
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:17.700
Oh, <i>great!</i> I think I understand.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:20.660
<i>This</i> is a true Beyblader spirit!

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:25.020
Fighting with everything you've got really resonates with peoples' hearts.

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:32.600
I don't really get this, but when I see them fighting like this, it makes me itch to fight too!

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:36.020
Dang! How long before I can battle?!

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:42.980
This takes me back to when we used to play together.

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:45.330
It was so fun back then.

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:59.770
Hey, Rei-nii! You're way too strong!

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:00.800
Am I?

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:04.740
I'm sure if you practice, you'll
get as strong as I am in no time!

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:06.590
Really?

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:09.290
Yeah, I'm sure of it.
I promise you.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:12.650
If <i>you're</i> promising, Rei-nii, then I can believe it!

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:20.100
Beyblades are so fun, aren't they?

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:25.300
Yeah. And if you get better,
they will be even more fun.

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.770
I remember now. It was so fun.

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:33.510
I'm having fun now too.

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:37.800
Yeah. I'm really having fun now.

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:40.320
That's because you've gotten better.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:42.410
Because you've become stronger.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:44.130
This is marvelous!

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.560
I've never seen a battle like this in my life!

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:48.930
It's almost like they're dancing!

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:50.680
W-Wow!

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:53.430
<i>It's beautiful! It's wonderful!</i>

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:57.500
Why? Why does it feel so good to watch?!

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:01.100
Mao, fighting with everything you've got...

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:03.000
Was this what you meant?

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:04.500
Mao, you idiot!

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.930
What are you waiting for?!

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:12.450
The two Beyblades cross the castle roads with great skill.

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:15.940
And the ones fighting are the young ones who will build our future!

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:19.460
This truly is the place where past and future collide!

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:20.850
Do your best, both of you!

00:16:21.740 --> 00:16:22.970
Keep it up!

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:24.430
- Don't lose!
- Do your best!

00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:30.450
This is so fun, isn't it, Mao?

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:33.600
But every fight must have a conclusion.

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:35.500
You're right.

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:39.160
I wish we could go on like this forever, but we really can't.

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:45.480
Once this is over, will you go on another journey?

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:50.480
Whether I win or lose, we'll end up separated anyway?

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:57.120
After you left the Byakko Clan, I kept asking myself... Why didn't I tell you how I felt?

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.700
I regretted it so much.

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:03.960
I want to be with you. I want to
be with you for my whole life!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:09.140
I need to tell him! I must tell him before this battle ends!

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:15.800
Rei-nii, listen to me! I know you only see me as a little sister,

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:23.230
but I... I love you, Rei-nii!

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.620
I knew it.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.620
I knew all along.

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:35.320
Mao.

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.160
But for me,

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:41.010
For me, Beyblades are what
matters most to me right now.

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:44.760
Both you and the Byakko Clan,

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:47.970
you're still precious to me.

00:17:48.930 --> 00:17:54.060
And that's exactly why I'm fighting
you with everything I have now!

00:17:56.630 --> 00:18:00.990
Mao! No matter how far apart we are, we will always be comrades!

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:02.810
Comrades of the Byakko Clan!

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:05.940
The bond that connects us will never be torn apart!

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:13.060
The two of us... are connected by a strong bond...

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:19.210
That's right.

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:33.200
The two Sacred Beasts are playing together!

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:37.300
Yeah, they really look like they're having fun.

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:42.020
Oh? Both of them have created some space. Are they going to fight it out?

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.010
Are you gonna do it, Rei?

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:46.120
Rei-nii, I'm not going to lose!

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:47.970
I'm not gonna lose either, Mao!

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:52.950
Go, Galux!

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:54.850
Byakko!

00:18:57.630 --> 00:18:58.620
Rei-nii!

00:18:58.620 --> 00:18:59.570
Mao!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.660
W-Wow! What the heck happened?!

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:13.080
After the violent clash, the two Beyblades are hidden by the dust!

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:27.560
Rei's Driger is still spinning!

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:46.500
I-It's settled! The winner of the match is Rei from the BBA team!

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:48.640
What a great battle!

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:50.340
You were both awesome!

00:19:57.100 --> 00:19:57.920
Mao.

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:03.450
I'm sorry, but I won this match.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:13.490
You're really kind, aren't you, Rei-nii...

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:18.580
Rei-nii, you <i>will</i> come back to
the Byakko Clan someday, right?

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:20.040
Of course.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:24.030
And when that happens, let's have fun Bey battling.

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:25.820
I'll wait for you!

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:28.420
I'll get even stronger and wait for you!

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:34.290
I will become much much stronger than I am now, too.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:37.620
Mao!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.880
Are you sure you shouldn't be going back to <i>their</i> booth?

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:45.700
Why did you lose?!

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:48.280
Did this battle mean nothing to you?!

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:52.530
You opened your heart to a
traitor, and you even <i>lost</i> to him!

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:56.900
Lai-nii...

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:00.160
You stain the Byakko Clan's honour!

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:06.500
Now both teams have won one match.

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:09.170
Who will win the Asian tournament? The Chinese team?

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:12.290
Or will it be the BBA team?

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.520
Takao, I leave the rest to you.

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:18.720
You can count on me.

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:21.300
I won't put to waste your great efforts.

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:23.310
Dragoon and I...

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:27.010
will win no matter what!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.090 --> 00:23:02.260
According to my analysis, we've finally reached the last match of the Asian tournament.

00:23:02.260 --> 00:23:04.000
It's Lai vs Takao!

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:08.950
Lai uses a new move that goes far beyond the Tiger Claw!

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:10.820
Takao is in serious trouble!

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:15.020
Oh, what now? It seems that Rei and Lai have started fighting against each other?

00:23:15.020 --> 00:23:16.720
What in the world..?

00:23:17.010 --> 00:23:20.500
Next time: Final Battle!
The Jet Black Lightning!

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:24.400
I always knew the last battle would be a fated one.
